---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title:
description: クサ的私人紙上植物園，收存插畫、文字與緩慢生長的片段。
---
<section class="hero shell" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
  <div class="hero__copy">
    <p class="eyebrow">PRIVATE PAPER GARDEN · EST. {{ site.established }}</p>
    <h1 id="hero-title">
      <span>{{ site.name }}</span>
      <small>{{ site.subtitle }}</small>
    </h1>
    <p class="hero__tagline">{{ site.tagline }}</p>
    <p class="hero__intro">由 {{ site.author }} 收存插畫、文字，以及一些緩慢生長的片段。它們不必急著成為作品，也可以保留尚未完成的樣子。</p>
    <div class="hero__actions">
      <a class="button button--primary" href="/gallery/">翻閱葉影帖</a>
      <a class="button button--quiet" href="/journal/">閱讀生長記 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="hero__specimen" aria-hidden="true" data-hero-parallax>
    <div class="specimen-frame">
      <div class="specimen-frame__meta">
        <span>ARCHIVE CARD</span>
        <span>001 / {{ site.established }}</span>
      </div>
      <div class="specimen-frame__words">
        <span>葉</span><span>光</span><span>夢</span><span>日常</span>
      </div>
      <div class="specimen-frame__palette"><i></i><i></i><i></i></div>
      <p>COLLECTED<br>SLOWLY</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <a class="hero__scroll" href="#garden-map">
    <span aria-hidden="true"></span>
    ENTER THE ARCHIVE
  </a>
</section>

<section class="garden-note" id="garden-map">
  <div class="garden-note__inner shell">
    <p class="garden-note__number">01</p>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">A NOTE FROM THE GARDEN</p>
      <h2>一座用來慢慢存放的園子</h2>
    </div>
    <p>插畫收入葉影帖，日常落進生長記，年份與標籤則留在採集簿裡。</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="collection shell section" aria-labelledby="collection-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">GARDEN DIRECTORY</p>
      <h2 id="collection-title">園內目錄</h2>
    </div>
    <p>從一張畫、一段話，或某個日期開始翻閱。</p>
  </div>

  <div class="collection-grid">
    <a class="collection-card collection-card--mint" href="/gallery/">
      <span class="collection-card__index">A—01</span>
      <div class="collection-card__copy">
        <span class="collection-card__en">GALLERY</span>
        <h3>葉影帖</h3>
        <p>插畫與視覺標本</p>
      </div>
      <strong><span>{{ collections.gallery.length | pad2 }}</span><small>PIECES</small></strong>
      <span class="collection-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
    <a class="collection-card collection-card--yellow" href="/journal/">
      <span class="collection-card__index">B—02</span>
      <div class="collection-card__copy">
        <span class="collection-card__en">JOURNAL</span>
        <h3>生長記</h3>
        <p>圖文、隨筆與日常記錄</p>
      </div>
      <strong><span>{{ collections.posts.length | pad2 }}</span><small>ENTRIES</small></strong>
      <span class="collection-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
    <a class="collection-card collection-card--ink" href="/tags/">
      <span class="collection-card__index">C—03</span>
      <div class="collection-card__copy">
        <span class="collection-card__en">INDEX</span>
        <h3>採集簿</h3>
        <p>依年份與標籤翻找</p>
      </div>
      <strong><span>{{ collections.topicList.length | pad2 }}</span><small>LABELS</small></strong>
      <span class="collection-card__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </a>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="latest shell section" aria-labelledby="latest-title">
  <div class="section-heading">
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">RECENT FIELD NOTES</p>
      <h2 id="latest-title">最近入園</h2>
    </div>
    <a class="text-link" href="/journal/">查看全部記錄 →</a>
  </div>

  <div class="post-grid">
    {% for post in collections.posts | take(3) %}
      {% include "partials/post-card.njk" %}
    {% endfor %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="keeper shell section">
  <div class="keeper__card">
    <div class="keeper__seal" aria-hidden="true">K<br>26</div>
    <div>
      <p class="eyebrow">ABOUT THE KEEPER</p>
      <h2>園丁：{{ site.author }}</h2>
      <p>畫畫、記錄，也觀察那些尚未被命名的細小變化。</p>
    </div>
    <a class="button button--quiet" href="/about/">前往園丁室</a>
  </div>
</section>
